    <item>
      <title>Customizing Quick Sight Visuals</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/CUDOS-with-AmazonQuick/07-customize-quick-sight/01-custom-visuals/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/CUDOS-with-AmazonQuick/07-customize-quick-sight/01-custom-visuals/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;aws-badge &#34;&gt;Amazon Quick Sight&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;span class=&#34;aws-badge &#34;&gt;Visuals&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;span class=&#34;aws-badge &#34;&gt;Filters&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;aws-duration&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;far fa-clock&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Estimated duration:&lt;/strong&gt; 15 mins&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;customizing-quick-sight-visuals&#34;&gt;Customizing Quick Sight Visuals&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;step-1--create-an-editable-analysis&#34;&gt;Step 1 — Create an editable analysis&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Open CUDOS and use the available &lt;strong&gt;Save as / Create analysis from dashboard&lt;/strong&gt; capability.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Name:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-text&#34; data-lang=&#34;text&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;FinOps Workshop Analysis&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;aws-callout callout-note&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;p&gt;&lt;p&gt;📸 &lt;strong&gt;Screenshot placeholder — &lt;code&gt;07-01-save-as-analysis.png&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Capture the CUDOS save-as/create-analysis operation.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Replace this block with the real screenshot after completing the step.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;step-2--open-the-analysis-editor&#34;&gt;Step 2 — Open the analysis editor&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;aws-callout callout-note&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;p&gt;&lt;p&gt;📸 &lt;strong&gt;Screenshot placeholder — &lt;code&gt;07-02-analysis-editor.png&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Creating Custom Calculated Fields</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/CUDOS-with-AmazonQuick/07-customize-quick-sight/02-calculated-fields/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/CUDOS-with-AmazonQuick/07-customize-quick-sight/02-calculated-fields/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;aws-badge &#34;&gt;Amazon Quick Sight&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;span class=&#34;aws-badge &#34;&gt;Calculated Fields&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;span class=&#34;aws-badge &#34;&gt;FinOps&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;aws-duration&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;far fa-clock&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Estimated duration:&lt;/strong&gt; 15 mins&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;creating-custom-calculated-fields&#34;&gt;Creating Custom Calculated Fields&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Calculated fields are useful for presentation-level logic. Core financial semantics should remain in a reusable semantic/query layer.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;step-1--create-a-safe-calculated-field&#34;&gt;Step 1 — Create a safe calculated field&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Open the analysis and choose &lt;strong&gt;Add calculated field&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Name:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-text&#34; data-lang=&#34;text&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Spend Band&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Example expression:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-text&#34; data-lang=&#34;text&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;ifelse(&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    {unblended_cost} &amp;gt;= 1000,&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    &amp;#39;High Spend&amp;#39;,&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    &amp;#39;Standard&amp;#39;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;)&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Adapt the field name and threshold to the real dataset and workshop purpose.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
